    <item>
      <title>C&#43;&#43;11: std::move</title>
      <link>https://eminfedar.github.io/blog/cpp/c&#43;&#43;11/c&#43;&#43;11-move/</link>
      <category>c&#43;&#43;11</category>
      <category>c&#43;&#43;</category><pubDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2020 12:00:03 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://eminfedar.github.io/blog/cpp/c&#43;&#43;11/c&#43;&#43;11-move/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Merhabalar, bu yazıda C++11 sürümünde dile eklenmiş &lt;code&gt;std::move&lt;/code&gt; keywordünü inceleyeceğiz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;nasıl-kullanılır&#34;&gt;Nasıl kullanılır?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-cpp&#34; data-lang=&#34;cpp&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;std&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;string a &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;selam&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;std&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;string b &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;merhaba&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// a = &amp;#34;selam&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// b = &amp;#34;merhaba&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;b &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; a;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// a = &amp;#34;selam&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// b = &amp;#34;selam&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;b &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; std&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;move(a);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// a = &amp;#34;&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// b = &amp;#34;selam&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;ne-işe-yarar&#34;&gt;Ne işe yarar?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir nesneyi taşıyarak başka bir değişkene aktarmaktadır. Normal eşitlemeden farkı ise, nesnenin taşınmasıyla eski değişkene artık ihtiyaç duyulmayan durumlarda kullanılır.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>C&#43;&#43;11: constexpr</title>
      <link>https://eminfedar.github.io/blog/cpp/c&#43;&#43;11/c&#43;&#43;11-constexpr/</link>
      <category>c&#43;&#43;11</category>
      <category>c&#43;&#43;</category><pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2020 00:06:03 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://eminfedar.github.io/blog/cpp/c&#43;&#43;11/c&#43;&#43;11-constexpr/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Merhabalar, bu yazıda C++11 sürümünde dile eklenmiş &lt;strong&gt;constexpr&lt;/strong&gt; terimini inceleyeceğiz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;nedir&#34;&gt;Nedir?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;constexpr&lt;/strong&gt; derleme esnasında(compile-time) sonucu belli olan, sabit değer döndüren bir fonksiyon, hatta ifadelerin tanımlanması için kullanılır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;İyi de bunu zaten makrolar yapıyor?&amp;rdquo; diyebilirsiniz.
&lt;br&gt;
Örneğin &lt;code&gt;#define UZUNLUK 10&lt;/code&gt; gibi. &lt;em&gt;(bu da derleme esnasında bilinen sabit bir değer?)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veya sabit bir değişkene ihtiyacımız varsa zaten &lt;strong&gt;const&lt;/strong&gt; ile tanımlayabiliyoruz.
&lt;br&gt;
Örneğin &lt;code&gt;const int UZUNLUK = 10;&lt;/code&gt; gibi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;constexpr&lt;/strong&gt; ise derleme esnasında yapılacak işlemi basit makro kopyala-yapıştırı ve sabit değişken tanımlayabilmenin de ötesine çıkarıp, bu ikisinin birleşerek daha kapsamlı ve dilin kendisine ait bir işlevi olmuş halidir diyebiliriz.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>C&#43;&#43;11: enum class</title>
      <link>https://eminfedar.github.io/blog/cpp/c&#43;&#43;11/c&#43;&#43;11-enum-class/</link>
      <category>c&#43;&#43;11</category>
      <category>c&#43;&#43;</category><pubDate>Mon, 16 Mar 2020 12:00:03 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://eminfedar.github.io/blog/cpp/c&#43;&#43;11/c&#43;&#43;11-enum-class/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Merhabalar, bu yazıda C++11 sürümünde dile eklenmiş &lt;code&gt;enum class&lt;/code&gt;&amp;lsquo;ı inceleyeceğiz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;nasıl-kullanılır&#34;&gt;Nasıl kullanılır?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-cpp&#34; data-lang=&#34;cpp&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;enum&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;Araba&lt;/span&gt; { TOGG, Tesla, Faraday };
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Araba&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;TOGG;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Araba&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;Tesla;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Not: enum + class kelimelerinin birleşmesi değildir, &amp;ldquo;enum class&amp;rdquo; kendi bir keyworddür.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;ne-işe-yarar&#34;&gt;Ne işe yarar?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;enum class&lt;/strong&gt; ile &lt;strong&gt;enum&lt;/strong&gt; aynı amaçla yani &lt;strong&gt;sabit tanımlı değerler&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;(örneğin haftanın günleri, yıldaki aylar, yazı yaslama seçenekleri (LEFT, CENTER, RIGHT gibi))&lt;/em&gt; oluşturmak için kullanılır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;enum class&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;lsquo;ın ise normal &lt;strong&gt;enum&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;lsquo;dan farkı var:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;enum class&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;rsquo;lar &lt;strong&gt;int&lt;/strong&gt;, başka bir &lt;strong&gt;enum&lt;/strong&gt; veya başka bir &lt;strong&gt;enum class&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;lsquo;a dönüştürülemezler. Kendilerine hastırlar &lt;em&gt;(yani unique)&lt;/em&gt;:
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-cpp&#34; data-lang=&#34;cpp&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;enum&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;Araba&lt;/span&gt; { TOGG, Tesla, Faraday };
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;enum&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;Hayvan&lt;/span&gt; { At, Leylek, Kedi };
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// Araba::TOGG == Hayvan::At; // Derleme hatası:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// ERROR: no match for ‘operator==’ (operand types are ‘Araba’ and ‘Hayvan’)  
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-cpp&#34; data-lang=&#34;cpp&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;enum&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;Hayvan&lt;/span&gt; { At, Leylek, Kedi };
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;enum&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;Elektronik&lt;/span&gt; { Bilgisayar, Telefon, Ekran };
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Elektronik&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;Bilgisayar &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;==&lt;/span&gt; Hayvan&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;At; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// 1 (true)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Yukarıda Bilgisayar At&amp;rsquo;a eşit oldu. Çünkü &lt;strong&gt;enum&lt;/strong&gt; ile tanımlanan değerler varsayılan olarak 0&amp;rsquo;dan başlayarak &lt;strong&gt;int&lt;/strong&gt; değerlere atanırlar:
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-cpp&#34; data-lang=&#34;cpp&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;enum&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;Hayvan&lt;/span&gt; { At&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;, Leylek&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;, Kedi&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; };
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;enum&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;Elektronik&lt;/span&gt; { Bilgisayar&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;, Telefon&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;, Ekran&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; };
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kıyaslamalar ve atamalar esnasında bu karışıklığın meydana gelmemesi için &lt;strong&gt;enum class&lt;/strong&gt; anahtar kelimesi ortaya çıkmıştır.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;(yani At&amp;rsquo;ın Bilgisayar&amp;rsquo;a eşit çıkmaması için :))&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>C&#43;&#43;11: Lambda</title>
      <link>https://eminfedar.github.io/blog/cpp/c&#43;&#43;11/c&#43;&#43;11-lambda-fonksiyonlar/</link>
      <category>c&#43;&#43;11</category>
      <category>c&#43;&#43;</category><pubDate>Wed, 11 Mar 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://eminfedar.github.io/blog/cpp/c&#43;&#43;11/c&#43;&#43;11-lambda-fonksiyonlar/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Merhabalar, bu yazıda C++11 sürümünde dile eklenmiş &lt;strong&gt;Lambda Fonksiyonlar&lt;/strong&gt;ı inceleyeceğiz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;nasıl-kullanılır&#34;&gt;Nasıl kullanılır?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-cpp&#34; data-lang=&#34;cpp&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// Tanım:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;, Ek scope değişkenleri] (fonksiyonun parametreleri...)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;{
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// Kodlar...
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/strong&gt;  : Üst scope&amp;rsquo;taki değişkenlerin &lt;strong&gt;bizzat kendilerini&lt;/strong&gt; al.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;=&lt;/strong&gt;  : Üst scope&amp;rsquo;taki değişkenlerin sadece &lt;strong&gt;değerlerini&lt;/strong&gt; al.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/strong&gt; kullanımına örnek:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-cpp&#34; data-lang=&#34;cpp&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; a &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;auto&lt;/span&gt; fonksiyon &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; [&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;]() {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    a &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    std&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;cout &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt; a; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// 10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;};
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;fonksiyon();
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;=&lt;/strong&gt; kullanına örnek:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-cpp&#34; data-lang=&#34;cpp&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; a &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;auto&lt;/span&gt; fonksiyon &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; [&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;]() {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// a = 10; ERROR: expression must be a modifiable lvalue
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;    std&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;cout &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt; a; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// Değerini kullanabiliriz.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;};
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;fonksiyon();
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not:&lt;/strong&gt; Varsayılan olarak scope &amp;ldquo;değer&amp;rdquo; olarak çalışır. &lt;em&gt;(yani boş bırakırsanız [] ile [=] aynı)&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Not2:&lt;/strong&gt; Eğer parametre girmeyecekseniz parametre parantezlerini &lt;code&gt;()&lt;/code&gt; yazmayabilirsiniz:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>C&#43;&#43;11: auto</title>
      <link>https://eminfedar.github.io/blog/cpp/c&#43;&#43;11/c&#43;&#43;11-auto/</link>
      <category>c&#43;&#43;11</category>
      <category>c&#43;&#43;</category><pubDate>Tue, 10 Mar 2020 12:00:03 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://eminfedar.github.io/blog/cpp/c&#43;&#43;11/c&#43;&#43;11-auto/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Merhabalar, bu yazıda C++11 sürümünde dile eklenmiş &lt;code&gt;auto&lt;/code&gt; keywordünü inceleyeceğiz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;nasıl-kullanılır&#34;&gt;Nasıl kullanılır?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-cpp&#34; data-lang=&#34;cpp&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;auto&lt;/span&gt; a &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;auto&lt;/span&gt; a &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Selam&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;auto&lt;/span&gt; a &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; Araba(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;TOGG&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;ne-işe-yarar&#34;&gt;Ne işe yarar?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;1-değişken-tipinin-derleyici-tarafından-otomatik-tanımlanmasını-sağlar&#34;&gt;1. Değişken &lt;strong&gt;tipinin&lt;/strong&gt; derleyici tarafından otomatik tanımlanmasını sağlar:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-cpp&#34; data-lang=&#34;cpp&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; a &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;auto&lt;/span&gt; b &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; a;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;typeid&lt;/span&gt;(a) &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;==&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;typeid&lt;/span&gt;(b); &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// true
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;2-uzun-tip-tanımlamalarından-kurtarır&#34;&gt;2. Uzun tip tanımlamalarından kurtarır:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-cpp&#34; data-lang=&#34;cpp&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;UzunBirSinifAdi&lt;/span&gt; {};
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// Açık tanım:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;UzunBirSinifAdi&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; nesne2 &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; UzunBirSinifAdi;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// Auto:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;auto&lt;/span&gt; nesne &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; UzunBirSinifAdi;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;typeid&lt;/span&gt;(nesne) &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;==&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;typeid&lt;/span&gt;(nesne2); &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// true
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;3-container-tipindeki-değişkenlerin-içini-gezerken-kolaylık-sağlar&#34;&gt;3. &lt;strong&gt;Container&lt;/strong&gt; tipindeki değişkenlerin içini gezerken kolaylık sağlar:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-cpp&#34; data-lang=&#34;cpp&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;std&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;vector&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; dizi &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; { &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; };
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// Açık tanım (explicit)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; (std&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;vector&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;::&lt;/span&gt;iterator i &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; dizi.begin(); i &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;!=&lt;/span&gt; dizi.end(); i&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;++&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;{
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    std&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;cout &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;i &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;, &amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// 1, 2, 3,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// Auto
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;auto&lt;/span&gt; i &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; dizi.begin(); i &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;!=&lt;/span&gt; dizi.end(); i&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;++&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;{
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    std&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;cout &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;i &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;, &amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// 1, 2, 3,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// En temizi:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;auto&lt;/span&gt; i : dizi)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;{
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    std&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;cout &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt; i &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;, &amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// 1, 2, 3,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; normalDizi[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;] &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; { &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#ae81ff&#34;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; };
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;auto&lt;/span&gt; i: normalDizi)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;{
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    std&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;::&lt;/span&gt;cout &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt; i &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;, &amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// 1, 2, 3,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;ne-değildir&#34;&gt;Ne değildir?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;1-javascriptteki-var-let-değildir&#34;&gt;1. Javascript&amp;rsquo;teki &amp;ldquo;&lt;strong&gt;var, let&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;rdquo; değildir:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(Python&amp;rsquo;daki değişkenler gibi de değildir)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    
